  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under IRC Section 6694(a), the penalty for an unreasonable position is the greater of $1,000 or 50% of the income derived by the preparer. A position must have substantial authority to avoid the penalty, or it must be disclosed and have a reasonable basis.
Wrong (A): The $250 threshold is incorrect. Section 6694(a) sets the minimum penalty at $1,000, not $250.
