  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under SSARS No. 21 (AR-C Section 80.21), when a CPA performing a compilation becomes aware that financial statements are materially misstated and the client refuses to correct them, the CPA should withdraw from the engagement. The CPA should also consider whether to inform known users under AR-C Section 80.22.
