  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under the Restatement (Third) of Suretyship and Guaranty Section 41, a material modification of the underlying obligation without the surety''s consent releases the surety to the extent of any loss caused by the modification. The surety''s risk was changed without consent, creating a valid defense.
Wrong (A): The debtor''s minority is a defense personal to the debtor and generally does not release the surety from liability to the creditor.
