  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under Section 523(a)(2) of the Bankruptcy Code, debts obtained by false pretenses, false representation, or actual fraud are excepted from discharge. The creditor must file a timely adversary proceeding to have the debt declared non-dischargeable.
